Your solution works now:

Use:

p + theme(legend.position="right") + scale_color_manual(values = c("red", "blue", "green"), breaks=c("CZ", "GZ", "HK")) + scale_shape_manual(values = seq(3), breaks=c("CZ", "GZ", "HK"))

Instead of:

p + theme(legend.position="right")

Thanks.

Best,
Xiaowei

